      <title>Western Bridge Rebuild Back on Track</title>
      <link>https://mckinleypark.news/news/7929-western-bridge-rebuild-back-on-track</link>
      <description>Reconstruction of the South Western Avenue bridge will restart in fall 2026, dependent on funding from a planned summer vote in the Chicago City Council. Road and bridge fixes to start after two-year delay. Funding requires summer city council vote. Traffic to shift between boulevard and avenue during 18 months of construction.</description>
